  "title": "Emergent BioSolutions Secures Long-Term Strategic Manufacturing Contract with SAB Biotherapeutics to Advance Type 1 Diabetes Candidate, SAB-142",
  "summary": "GAITHERSBURG, Md., April 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Emergent BioSolutions Inc. (NYSE: EBS) today announced a multi-year agreement with SAB Biotherapeutics, Inc. (Nasdaq: SABS, SAB BIO) to support the process development and manufacturing of SAB-142, SAB BIO’s lead program in clinical development",
